  },
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "S01-001",
      "act": "S01",
      "text": "教师：找一个最近的新闻，看看最初的报道和后续有没有区别。下节课我们讨论。",
      "source_start_s": 0.5,
      "source_end_s": 11.8,
      "file_start_s": 0.35,
      "file_end_s": 11.950000000000001,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000002,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S01-001.flac",
      "sha256": "dd865c06f91129ea5c8e6e1bc595aa27a87f704390c9f21559ad052ca32b1a1a",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S01-002",
      "act": "S01",
      "text": "周然：要交吗？",
      "source_start_s": 12.0,
      "source_end_s": 13.5,
      "file_start_s": 11.85,
      "file_end_s": 13.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000036,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S01-002.flac",
      "sha256": "1849408a43e695cf483c0f82161f38588734c561b50d0d69c0dbe29d0ff10b4d",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S01-003",
      "act": "S01",
      "text": "教师：不用交，找一件你自己看过的就行。",
      "source_start_s": 13.8,
      "source_end_s": 17.8,
      "file_start_s": 13.65,
      "file_end_s": 17.95,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000036,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S01-003.flac",
      "sha256": "da9704445ba5cd3a037d648baaefb97299369e4f21dfee07514f1007cdb6ea43",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S01-004",
      "act": "S01",
      "text": "A：那不都是反转新闻。",
      "source_start_s": 18.5,
      "source_end_s": 21.8,
      "file_start_s": 18.35,
      "file_end_s": 21.95,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999999858,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S01-004.flac",
      "sha256": "c95c85b6175cbfa845ab668f098d95f49498820be288153bcedd359d8916effa",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S01-005",
      "act": "S01",
      "text": "周然：你找一个。",
      "source_start_s": 22.4,
      "source_end_s": 24.6,
      "file_start_s": 22.25,
      "file_end_s": 24.75,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999999858,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S01-005.flac",
      "sha256": "d1bb19b1b2703a9cfa272afea71f21fc06b5e566f87a686f694169f999c3e8b0",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S01-006",
      "act": "S01",
      "text": "A：一开始说这个，过两天又说那个，谁知道哪个是真的。",
      "source_start_s": 27.2,
      "source_end_s": 33.4,
      "file_start_s": 27.05,
      "file_end_s": 33.55,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999999858,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S01-006.flac",
      "sha256": "93be1b8547ca71700de1264257719f97d26cfe3b2856e4d6ae2e25228fdfff64",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S01-007",
      "act": "S01",
      "text": "教师：所以别只记结论。把它为什么改了也带过来。",
      "source_start_s": 33.7,
      "source_end_s": 38.8,
      "file_start_s": 33.550000000000004,
      "file_end_s": 38.949999999999996,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999999858,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S01-007.flac",
      "sha256": "707d109a66c8be97409ce98105714c1d65be5526135532c983f48cee91b4f218",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S01-008",
      "act": "S01",
      "text": "周然：后门那边出事了。",
      "source_start_s": 46.8,
      "source_end_s": 49.5,
      "file_start_s": 46.65,
      "file_end_s": 49.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999999858,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S01-008.flac",
      "sha256": "9daf175d5cf24cb009694b8bfb2d2467f89405b7a48d01f9a9d26a440528c1e2",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S02-009",
      "act": "S02",
      "text": "路人：我到这了。那个门封了，你绕到——",
      "source_start_s": 55.5,
      "source_end_s": 59.8,
      "file_start_s": 55.35,
      "file_end_s": 59.949999999999996,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999999858,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S02-009.flac",
      "sha256": "892acb1c01d2b5f6181b3a451297af00c9dca801fee8bb4306022afd7f601cf5",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S02-010",
      "act": "S02",
      "text": "路人：哎，你怎么推人啊？",
      "source_start_s": 65.6,
      "source_end_s": 68.0,
      "file_start_s": 65.44999999999999,
      "file_end_s": 68.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S02-010.flac",
      "sha256": "bdfa046dcd5efa8da78912e5458995f246488e7534ef0e5228b762d91458739d",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S02-011",
      "act": "S02",
      "text": "陈师傅：先起来，这儿不能待。",
      "source_start_s": 68.2,
      "source_end_s": 71.0,
      "file_start_s": 68.05,
      "file_end_s": 71.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S02-011.flac",
      "sha256": "20851a948d374887c1e6b727852b8f7fcd0e9a6becdc0fc0cc26046bc369e314",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S02-012",
      "act": "S02",
      "text": "老人：我腿……等一下。",
      "source_start_s": 71.2,
      "source_end_s": 74.4,
      "file_start_s": 71.05,
      "file_end_s": 74.55000000000001,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S02-012.flac",
      "sha256": "4891b23dd200977a50f1c82abe4da7f7f6cc3655c1efb738cdff4ade1dd9c160",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S02-013",
      "act": "S02",
      "text": "工友：都离远点！",
      "source_start_s": 75.0,
      "source_end_s": 77.5,
      "file_start_s": 74.85,
      "file_end_s": 77.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S02-013.flac",
      "sha256": "3568de99211d840d9205ddaffca0bae1d07da62d3b84053c89ddc190dbab0e18",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S03-014",
      "act": "S03",
      "text": "A：怎么突然推他？",
      "source_start_s": 104.0,
      "source_end_s": 107.0,
      "file_start_s": 103.85,
      "file_end_s": 107.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S03-014.flac",
      "sha256": "5fe66334bfedec13a9f1bbedf5b34a59b30cc777964343400a49856ac4beb803",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S03-015",
      "act": "S03",
      "text": "周然：前面是不是吵起来了？",
      "source_start_s": 109.0,
      "source_end_s": 112.0,
      "file_start_s": 108.85,
      "file_end_s": 112.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S03-015.flac",
      "sha256": "59c9be1c87f9c773bce1a2c1c94b33a6a81f5190ac5950fcd208433b5787e706",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S03-016",
      "act": "S03",
      "text": "A：还真是吵起来了。",
      "source_start_s": 132.0,
      "source_end_s": 134.5,
      "file_start_s": 131.85,
      "file_end_s": 134.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S03-016.flac",
      "sha256": "2abd0e5f6e3818683955be8d05b7dfd3cdbfe1b120b40e4af3593ca64ba38cd5",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S03-017",
      "act": "S03",
      "text": "周然：让人过去不就完了。",
      "source_start_s": 135.0,
      "source_end_s": 138.0,
      "file_start_s": 134.85,
      "file_end_s": 138.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S03-017.flac",
      "sha256": "2a5b88d14b661b028e0de616c73c8694f35f9a68e13f4a890b61483aeae41b7a",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S03-018",
      "act": "S03",
      "text": "A：工地不让过，跟老人吵起来了。",
      "source_start_s": 157.0,
      "source_end_s": 161.5,
      "file_start_s": 156.85,
      "file_end_s": 161.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S03-018.flac",
      "sha256": "1eb33f83a48128df8f5dba2d28a6f2769476aca0a9f7de5d94f024bab8b2e49f",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S03-019",
      "act": "S03",
      "text": "周然：吃饭去？",
      "source_start_s": 163.0,
      "source_end_s": 165.0,
      "file_start_s": 162.85,
      "file_end_s": 165.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S03-019.flac",
      "sha256": "a679cc07189388345584999cb21486ea344a31a5bf87016b4e79ab5557dd6298",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S03-020",
      "act": "S03",
      "text": "A：等下。",
      "source_start_s": 165.5,
      "source_end_s": 167.0,
      "file_start_s": 165.35,
      "file_end_s": 167.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S03-020.flac",
      "sha256": "352be7ddc9110073fbc7498823b7d39b9e7ff423627a73806879b14ca4776365",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-021",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "陈师傅：喂？",
      "source_start_s": 179.0,
      "source_end_s": 180.3,
      "file_start_s": 178.85,
      "file_end_s": 180.45000000000002,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-021.flac",
      "sha256": "4c6b291bc69fafc0173f0a3e933e48fe1e9469a0687eff3f21f21fa517498978",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-022",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "陌生人：你就是视频里那个？",
      "source_start_s": 180.8,
      "source_end_s": 183.5,
      "file_start_s": 180.65,
      "file_end_s": 183.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-022.flac",
      "sha256": "645470fd5ba9975971f23bf0b407e615318584370f85ebbd32481d7ce9c96c89",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-023",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "陈师傅：这谁发出去的？",
      "source_start_s": 193.5,
      "source_end_s": 196.0,
      "file_start_s": 193.35,
      "file_end_s": 196.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-023.flac",
      "sha256": "51dff320dd0a9c5d2dacdd5f34112e2055737616a51abecec71c92d78b4f0cfa",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-024",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "工友：不知道，转得到处都是。",
      "source_start_s": 196.4,
      "source_end_s": 200.0,
      "file_start_s": 196.25,
      "file_end_s": 200.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-024.flac",
      "sha256": "4fe46406b10e26219af0caa281fe7094372db99bc7ba1467a309c9074be28e1a",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-025",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "负责人：老陈，明天你先歇一天。",
      "source_start_s": 202.0,
      "source_end_s": 206.0,
      "file_start_s": 201.85,
      "file_end_s": 206.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-025.flac",
      "sha256": "ec099c72f7757926bda76e60da030aa30b9698032b515a1a400b1457f539f549",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-026",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "陈师傅：怎么就让我歇了？",
      "source_start_s": 206.3,
      "source_end_s": 209.5,
      "file_start_s": 206.15,
      "file_end_s": 209.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-026.flac",
      "sha256": "9c6f077a01b084640ff77dc5bea85cc9b83cebf428c7749f4039237e1e0a296f",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-027",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "负责人：门口一直有人问，我这边电话也没停。 先把昨天的事核清楚。",
      "source_start_s": 210.0,
      "source_end_s": 219.0,
      "file_start_s": 209.85,
      "file_end_s": 219.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-027.flac",
      "sha256": "9d16d35625c1564e5ac13de1ad4dfa62a14259d75f1b351af7fac54b6e5a3af1",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-028",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "陈师傅：你问昨天在的人啊。",
      "source_start_s": 219.4,
      "source_end_s": 222.5,
      "file_start_s": 219.25,
      "file_end_s": 222.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-028.flac",
      "sha256": "5fd9be07bbfba0876d27bf68fc77533638175db6f515f0f206e02ca37bccc22e",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-029",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "负责人：在问了，监控也在调。",
      "source_start_s": 223.0,
      "source_end_s": 226.0,
      "file_start_s": 222.85,
      "file_end_s": 226.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-029.flac",
      "sha256": "60d457137a9f93606f0c823c94421396571a377861a3aad3728ba80576a58627",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-030",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "妻子：你那边到底弄清楚没有？",
      "source_start_s": 230.0,
      "source_end_s": 234.0,
      "file_start_s": 229.85,
      "file_end_s": 234.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-030.flac",
      "sha256": "659288214ab014d2c0abde6cc66a6743536e2a14c982eee5a14636085c3410fe",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-031",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "陈师傅：他们说在查。",
      "source_start_s": 234.3,
      "source_end_s": 236.0,
      "file_start_s": 234.15,
      "file_end_s": 236.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-031.flac",
      "sha256": "986613531e4a7c812d82d6a3c6f8ae73148305b68ee44aaa26fed65ade081637",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-032",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "妻子：怎么连我也找？",
      "source_start_s": 237.0,
      "source_end_s": 239.0,
      "file_start_s": 236.85,
      "file_end_s": 239.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-032.flac",
      "sha256": "a2a6c67703d3aaa0758405e6a4ca4a66ec3410210781ac564a0f35c205121ab9",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-033",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "妻子：以后这种事你少管。",
      "source_start_s": 241.0,
      "source_end_s": 244.0,
      "file_start_s": 240.85,
      "file_end_s": 244.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-033.flac",
      "sha256": "64c91ac53d0228df2dd533c85898f0c92a771c3d28e8e786d714813442d29bd7",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-034",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "陈师傅：行了，你别回他们。",
      "source_start_s": 244.4,
      "source_end_s": 247.0,
      "file_start_s": 244.25,
      "file_end_s": 247.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-034.flac",
      "sha256": "4596f9b193243c3a8d622a9add3aa9226f205d8d63e6146eb3ce30b9108baba9",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-035",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "工友：吃点东西吧。",
      "source_start_s": 249.0,
      "source_end_s": 251.0,
      "file_start_s": 248.85,
      "file_end_s": 251.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-035.flac",
      "sha256": "7d9c2256f5cfd59933ee1f5c74818bf8c9013f7570c0e7b3b831168c19f81fac",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S04-036",
      "act": "S04",
      "text": "陈师傅：明天算请假，还是算什么？",
      "source_start_s": 251.2,
      "source_end_s": 254.2,
      "file_start_s": 251.04999999999998,
      "file_end_s": 254.35,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.15000000000000568,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S04-036.flac",
      "sha256": "8386fa80cce7dd405c5dff789713aa2c94abd566afb59b807283b8a7830e65c9",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S05-037",
      "act": "S05",
      "text": "周然：你看群里。",
      "source_start_s": 267.0,
      "source_end_s": 269.0,
      "file_start_s": 266.85,
      "file_end_s": 269.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S05-037.flac",
      "sha256": "8f5ea44445c83bdbd714e9a2e8e04799e1eec1a57a99c8d3b796c50486ae1f37",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S05-038",
      "act": "S05",
      "text": "A：怎么了？",
      "source_start_s": 269.3,
      "source_end_s": 270.8,
      "file_start_s": 269.15000000000003,
      "file_end_s": 270.95,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S05-038.flac",
      "sha256": "a03311dd89f5b99194cf0745e4eb62ce83230d0a5437eec3e036a080e348d484",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S05-039",
      "act": "S05",
      "text": "周然：昨天那个。",
      "source_start_s": 271.0,
      "source_end_s": 273.0,
      "file_start_s": 270.85,
      "file_end_s": 273.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S05-039.flac",
      "sha256": "2802ec9b9b3b82d2912afde58e4f887699a99389238a496541209cfac2da32b2",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S05-040",
      "act": "S05",
      "text": "周然：真是在救他。",
      "source_start_s": 311.0,
      "source_end_s": 314.0,
      "file_start_s": 310.85,
      "file_end_s": 314.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S05-040.flac",
      "sha256": "23ff76a60176097164e9a4ae47a9fde61d8297c30e463f2ccd3bd76b0beecb5f",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S05-041",
      "act": "S05",
      "text": "周然：还是昨天那个号。",
      "source_start_s": 325.0,
      "source_end_s": 327.8,
      "file_start_s": 324.85,
      "file_end_s": 327.95,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S05-041.flac",
      "sha256": "589e897a73f35ef888d611ed4f8c7fba9fbe7e9edc0504078ee975d351a8103b",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-042",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：这件事，有人看过吗？",
      "source_start_s": 346.0,
      "source_end_s": 349.0,
      "file_start_s": 345.85,
      "file_end_s": 349.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-042.flac",
      "sha256": "dd550de50317abb9b17e52c12275d7413364a9d380f59bc38a1f8e095fe01b9f",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-043",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "学生：昨天到处都是。",
      "source_start_s": 350.0,
      "source_end_s": 352.0,
      "file_start_s": 349.85,
      "file_end_s": 352.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-043.flac",
      "sha256": "e7be4db64e38bad622a15485001f4d3b2125b3b8f943865764d765a2bed77f75",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-044",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：最开始大家怎么说？",
      "source_start_s": 353.0,
      "source_end_s": 356.0,
      "file_start_s": 352.85,
      "file_end_s": 356.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-044.flac",
      "sha256": "aa39062361c713438fd146fbaa230aa84e2cece282e934dafde5a58aeaf4178e",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-045",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "学生：工人跟老人吵架，把人推倒了。",
      "source_start_s": 357.0,
      "source_end_s": 361.0,
      "file_start_s": 356.85,
      "file_end_s": 361.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-045.flac",
      "sha256": "ab09dca5ee19c2d1e477f2d8439ee45d6642c1e3b2e1691708498e57f2e6e853",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-046",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：吵架这一段，你们在哪里看到的？",
      "source_start_s": 362.0,
      "source_end_s": 366.0,
      "file_start_s": 361.85,
      "file_end_s": 366.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-046.flac",
      "sha256": "73277ad1237fe48f783f3b26d2b7e4ac46ee3fa20f0c0443052aeabe75e13833",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-047",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "学生：新闻里写的。",
      "source_start_s": 367.0,
      "source_end_s": 369.0,
      "file_start_s": 366.85,
      "file_end_s": 369.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-047.flac",
      "sha256": "c0ddeaf50472aa8d1ce009f123cd6085bf4fd89b62412816500a61e3f402d02b",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-048",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：视频里有吗？",
      "source_start_s": 370.0,
      "source_end_s": 372.0,
      "file_start_s": 369.85,
      "file_end_s": 372.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-048.flac",
      "sha256": "afb3c909b64b14a716e8e0fc930c3d268f8b4076d776884c4199e833886fd924",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-049",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "A：没有，标题写的。",
      "source_start_s": 374.0,
      "source_end_s": 377.0,
      "file_start_s": 373.85,
      "file_end_s": 377.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-049.flac",
      "sha256": "5543c7345e5204808a9c9ec23a868d7523ac985ecc0541517389ba13ebb9e54b",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-050",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：那我们分开说。推人，录像拍到了。因为争执而推人，是后来加上的解释。",
      "source_start_s": 378.0,
      "source_end_s": 386.0,
      "file_start_s": 377.85,
      "file_end_s": 386.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-050.flac",
      "sha256": "105a82bd133acadbb96f6c1e6ac4a25fb4498c01e45086e054429f830d117977",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-051",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "学生：但是第一段，谁看了都会觉得他在欺负老人吧。",
      "source_start_s": 387.0,
      "source_end_s": 392.0,
      "file_start_s": 386.85,
      "file_end_s": 392.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-051.flac",
      "sha256": "6024e7bb2f8ddd53675fe68d16fe82d5349f6377702e3c6125eca6905e2547e3",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-052",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：有这种第一反应，不奇怪。问题是，当时的材料能不能证明这个原因？",
      "source_start_s": 393.0,
      "source_end_s": 400.0,
      "file_start_s": 392.85,
      "file_end_s": 400.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-052.flac",
      "sha256": "009b9d5cef598dc43826b001432be0cc13f75be0ef119c4330b205efd9c1c54f",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-053",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "学生：不能。",
      "source_start_s": 401.0,
      "source_end_s": 402.5,
      "file_start_s": 400.85,
      "file_end_s": 402.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-053.flac",
      "sha256": "bf51f82b5ad6dd0d6291a0f3db1844059bb9e70c569715be1a8f52f4517ac21b",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-054",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：后来为什么能改？",
      "source_start_s": 403.0,
      "source_end_s": 405.0,
      "file_start_s": 402.85,
      "file_end_s": 405.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-054.flac",
      "sha256": "6d4049b40e26f03ae1e5da76a7f7782b5d3de50759f9697bc5fb4b2574d270aa",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-055",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "学生：监控拍到旁边掉东西了。",
      "source_start_s": 406.0,
      "source_end_s": 409.0,
      "file_start_s": 405.85,
      "file_end_s": 409.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-055.flac",
      "sha256": "171d1b6936a510513f1852c4ca7624989f8755e32b9a11a7cfea38a914450cd2",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-056",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：对。原来不知道的条件补上了，同一个动作才有了不同的解释。",
      "source_start_s": 410.0,
      "source_end_s": 416.0,
      "file_start_s": 409.85,
      "file_end_s": 416.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-056.flac",
      "sha256": "2a9997bbef6261ad9de21b6f5f5a2b05a8c9e86f28ac28bf6998af9dfca23bf1",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-057",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "另一名学生：那以后只能等反转？",
      "source_start_s": 417.0,
      "source_end_s": 419.0,
      "file_start_s": 416.85,
      "file_end_s": 419.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-057.flac",
      "sha256": "124e0f2f40a7be72242bcf1f88d15db243a64cded32582cbb2f4b15e780308e0",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-058",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：不用等“反转”。不知道的部分，先别当成已经知道。",
      "source_start_s": 420.0,
      "source_end_s": 425.0,
      "file_start_s": 419.85,
      "file_end_s": 425.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-058.flac",
      "sha256": "6fb529c23c7e30d3f5481b90cc9ede75bf1c056a033c3593fa26f427add30472",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S06-059",
      "act": "S06",
      "text": "教师：今天就到这里。",
      "source_start_s": 428.0,
      "source_end_s": 430.0,
      "file_start_s": 427.85,
      "file_end_s": 430.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S06-059.flac",
      "sha256": "6b1fa436fa8c6e42945b71e19c843891b655558db759ac932bd2cb39eeaa4ab5",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S07-060",
      "act": "S07",
      "text": "周然：你那条还在啊？",
      "source_start_s": 431.0,
      "source_end_s": 433.0,
      "file_start_s": 430.85,
      "file_end_s": 433.15,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S07-060.flac",
      "sha256": "da55cba4e2cb25ea516fb6fc4e27b846525c43f6052d1c024c3fed3b0d49b4d6",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S07-061",
      "act": "S07",
      "text": "A：我也是看别人发的。",
      "source_start_s": 433.3,
      "source_end_s": 435.5,
      "file_start_s": 433.15000000000003,
      "file_end_s": 435.65,
      "speech_in_file_s": 0.14999999999997726,
      "path": "assets/production-v11-ready/audio-cues/S07-061.flac",
      "sha256": "fed5a2fe2a5eaa94ef418e2fcf8d90c6976d10bb21f446e18869384da1cf6ce0",
      "audio_type": "original_mixed_audio_not_isolated_dialogue",
      "status": "cut_from_legacy_cues_listen_and_align_to_windows_current_plan"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "S07-062",
      "act": "S07",
